  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-8 pt-8 lg:mb-16 breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/de/questions\">Häufige Frage</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><a href=\"/de/question_categories/shipping\">Transport</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><span>What does the Transport available label mean on a listing?</span></div><div class=\"lg:flex gap-16 mb-16\"><div class=\"lg:w-3/4\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-5xl mb-8\">What does the Transport available label mean on a listing?</h1><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-8 auction-body\"><p>It indicates that either the <strong>seller can arrange transport</strong>, or we work\nwith <strong>independent transport partners</strong> who cover the location where the item is stored.\n<strong>Bidders Highway does not provide transport services itself.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>When you win:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>After a <strong>winning bid</strong>, you can obtain a <strong>quote</strong> from our transport partners\n  (or from the seller, if the seller arranges the transport).</li>\n  <li>The transport is a <strong>separate service</strong> and will be <strong>invoiced separately</strong> by the\n  transport partner or seller. It is not included in the hammer price or our fees.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Good to know:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Bids are binding.</strong> Placed bids cannot be withdrawn during the auction or Aftersales\n  period under our terms.</li>\n  <li>The <strong>Buyer's fee</strong> is invoiced on <strong>Win</strong> and is normally <strong>due within\n  48 hours</strong>. The right of withdrawal for our <strong>platform services</strong> ends when the service\n  has been performed. Consumer rights (e.g., complaints) apply to the <strong>vehicle purchase</strong>\n  between buyer and seller - not to Bidders Highway's fees. Exceptions may apply per the terms (e.g.,\n  if the seller causes the transaction to fail).</li>\n  <li>As a bidder you have a <strong>duty to examine</strong> - review the description, photos and videos\n  and <strong>use the comments section</strong> so the seller can respond openly and directly. Visit the\n  item if possible.</li>\n  <li>All listing information is <strong>certified by the seller</strong> (private or professional).</li>\n  <li><strong>Bidders Highway is not a party</strong> to the purchase agreement or the transaction.</li>\n</ul></div></div><div class=\"lg:w-1/4 mt-8 lg:mt-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-6\">Kategorien</h2><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 lg:block\"><li><a href=\"/de/questions\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Alle</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/buying\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Einkaufen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/selling\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verkaufen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/bidding\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Bieten</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/documentation\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Dokumentation</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/account\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Konto</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/payment\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Zahlungen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/shipping\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent px-2 border-black! text-black! hover:text-black!\">Transport</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/verification\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verifizierung</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 pb-16\"><div class=\"w-full p-8 bg-amber-100 rounded sm:flex justify-between items-center\"><div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl sm:text-4xl mb-4\">Weitere Fragen?</h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base mb-2 sm:mb-8\">Sie können uns eine E-Mail senden. Wir helfen Ihnen gerne weiter!</p><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"font-bold underline hover:text-neutral-800\">support@biddershighway.com</a></div><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"hidden sm:block\"><img src=\"/assets/contact-us-4411369c.svg\" alt=\"Contact us\" class=\"w-48 h-36\"></a></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center py-8\"><a href=\"/de\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neutral-300 px-6 py-3\">Alle unsere Autoauktionen ansehen</a></div></div></main>",
